tion that M2 cannot be in R2 because overlapping with M1 and M3 would cause conflict if both in same room.\n\nThus answer.\n\nWe can also provide a brief explanation.\n\nThus final answer: mapping.\n\nWe'll output in Chinese.\n\nThus final.",
